  "description": "While the Turtles are watching TV, Krang appears on the news stealing the Statue of Liberty. Leonardo, Michelangelo, Donatello and Raphael chase the Foot Clan to the Technodrome, where Shredder sends them through a time warp. To get back home, they must fight their way through prehistoric jungles, pirate ships, a Wild West train and a futuristic space station, facing Foot soldiers and classic villains like Bebop, Rocksteady, Leatherhead and Krang. Up to four players can play together at once, throwing enemies right at the screen in Konami's colorful, cartoon-faithful sequel to the original TMNT arcade game.",
